frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x+C"]] "category" "reviewed_ma_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14059116/answer-source-reviews.json" "file_sha256" "2a4ed1f8c378be9c0bcd8a532e3a1dc421c94c566edd5f63f2eeb2868b85a5ac" "rationale" "For |x|<1, d(artanh x)/dx=1/(1−x²), so the derivative is √2/[3(1−x²)]. Original option e, the worked solution, and successful grading agree. Stored artanh x denotes the same function on the specified domain."}] "usage" {"q-95265" [] "q-95263" [] "q-95645" [] "e-8346" [] "e-8345" [] "q-95264" [] "e-8347" []} "basis" 1894 "retractions" [[17592186167276 :question/problem "What is $∫\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{x^{2} + 1}}dx$?"] [17592186167276 :question/answer-fields 17592186165205] [17592186167333 :question/problem "What is $∫(\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} + \\sinh x)dx$?"] [17592186167333 :question/answer-fields 17592186165546] [17592186167277 :question/problem "What is $∫\\frac{π}{\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}dx$?"] [17592186167277 :question/answer-fields 17592186165211] [17592186167278 :question/problem "Calculate $∫(\\sqrt{2})/(3(1 - x^{2}))dx$ for $\\mid x \\mid < 1$."] [17592186167278 :question/answer-fields 17592186165217] [17592186166528 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{-3}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\,\\textrm d x=$"] [17592186166528 :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nThe derivative of the inverse hyperbolic sine function is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arsinh x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n∫\\frac{-3}{\\sqrt{x^{2} + 1}}dx =-3∫\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^{2} + 1}}dx =-3arsinh x + C\n$$"] [17592186166529 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{\\ln{\\pi}}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\,\\textrm d x=$"] [17592186166529 :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nThe derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosine function is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arcosh x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n∫\\frac{\\ln π}{\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}dx = \\ln π∫\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}dx = \\ln πarcosh x + C\n$$"] [17592186166530 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nCalculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{1}{2(1-x^2)}\\,\\textrm d x$ for $\\mid x \\mid < 1$."] [17592186166530 :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nThe derivative of the inverse hyperbolic tangent function is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\artanh x) = \\dfrac{1}{1-x^2}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n∫(1)/(2(1 - x^{2}))dx = \\frac{1}{2}∫\\frac{1}{1 - x^{2}}dx = \\frac{1}{2}artanh x + C\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186165206 17592186165207 17592186165208 17592186165209 17592186165210 17592186165212 17592186165213 17592186165214 17592186165215 17592186165216 17592186165218 17592186165219 17592186165220 17592186165221 17592186165222 17592186165547 17592186165548 17592186165549 17592186165550 17592186165551] "immutable_fields" [[17